  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Title says it all. \nIt would be great to be able to hit play mode in unity after importing the VRC SDK and tick a box that allows for VR in play mode. This is useful for testing shaders and such / color grading and post processing. Edit - Apparently this is possible if you import your own Oculus SDK or SteamVR SDK. But it would still save a ton of hassle if it were in the VRC SDK by default. ",
